  "ja329:1.1": "Yaṃ annapān' assa pure labhāma ",
  "ja329:1.2": "taṃ dāni sākhāmigam eva gacchati, ",
  "ja329:1.3": "gacchāma dāni vanam eva Rādha ",
  "ja329:1.4": "asakkatā v' amhā Dhanañjayāyāti. ",
  "ja329:2.1": "Lābho alābho ayaso yaso ca (Dasaratha-Jāt. p.9.) ",
  "ja329:2.2": "nindā pasaṃsā ca sukhañ ca dukkhaṃ ",
  "ja329:2.3": "ete aniccā manujesu dhammā, ",
  "ja329:2.4": "mā soca, kiṃ socasi Poṭṭhapādāti. ",
  "ja329:3.1": "Addhā tuvaṃ paṇḍitako si Rādha, ",
  "ja329:3.2": "jānāsi atthāni anāgatāni, ",
  "ja329:3.3": "kathan nu sākhāmigaṃ dakkhisāma ",
  "ja329:3.4": "nibbāpitaṃ rājakulato va jammanti. ",
  "ja329:4.1": "Cāleti kaṇṇaṃ, bhakuṭiṃ karoti, ",
  "ja329:4.2": "muhuṃ muhuṃ bhāyayate kumāre, ",
  "ja329:4.3": "sayam eva taṃ kāhati Kālabāhu ",
  "ja329:4.4": "yenārakā ṭhassati annapānāti. ",
  "ja329:5.1": ""
}
